# 3. Why Qwen3-0.6B

Qwen3-0.6B is small enough to make CPU-based experimentation practical.

Approximate scale:

```text
Parameters: ~600M
```

This makes it useful for learning:

* tokenization
* datasets
* supervised fine-tuning
* LoRA
* QLoRA concepts
* loss
* epochs
* batch size
* gradient accumulation
* evaluation
* checkpointing
* inference
* model export

Do not expect CPU training to be fast. The purpose of this machine is experimentation and learning.

