# 12. LoRA

LoRA means:

```text
Low-Rank Adaptation
```

Instead of changing every parameter:

```text
Base model
600M parameters
       ↓
all parameters trainable
```

LoRA keeps the base model mostly frozen:

```text
Qwen3-0.6B
     │
     ├── Base weights
     │      frozen
     │
     └── LoRA adapters
            trainable
```

This significantly reduces the amount of trainable parameters and memory required.

