# 16. Evaluation

Never judge the model only from training loss.

Keep a separate:

```text
data/validation.jsonl
```

Example:

```json
{"instruction":"Classify the task.","input":"Set a reminder for 6 PM.","response":"{\"task_type\":\"create_schedule\"}"}
{"instruction":"Classify the task.","input":"Find information about Docker networking.","response":"{\"task_type\":\"search\"}"}
```

The validation examples must not be used during training.

Compare:

```text
Base model
     ↓
Validation dataset
     ↓
accuracy

Fine-tuned model
     ↓
Validation dataset
     ↓
accuracy
```

