# 17. Important Training Metrics

Understand these before experimenting with hyperparameters.

### Training loss

Generally:

```text
lower loss
    ↓
better fit to training data
```

But extremely low training loss can indicate overfitting.

### Validation loss

Useful for determining whether the model generalizes.

Example:

```text
Epoch 1
train loss: 2.1
validation loss: 2.3

Epoch 2
train loss: 1.4
validation loss: 1.7

Epoch 3
train loss: 0.8
validation loss: 2.2
```

The third epoch may be overfitting.

