# 26. Long-Term Direction

After learning the fundamentals, this project can evolve into:

```text
Qwen3-0.6B
     │
     ├── Hermes classifier
     ├── Intent classification
     ├── Structured JSON generation
     ├── Lightweight local assistant
     └── CPU fallback model
```

For Hermes, keep the fine-tuned model specialized rather than trying to make this small model perform every task.

Use larger/cloud models for:

```text
complex coding
long reasoning
large document analysis
complex tool planning
```

and Qwen3-0.6B for:

```text
classification
routing
simple structured generation
lightweight local inference
```

This gives you both a useful training exercise and a realistic production architecture.

